  "raw": " perfected the art of the super soldier,\" a gleeful President Ronald Reagan announces in the 1989 blockbuster of that name. The secret project the US has dubbed Project Cadmus is finally ready to reveal itself to the world, and by the time this film hits theaters in July, the first of its kind will have emerged. But while the government knows these superspies will be its most powerful asset in times of war, it refuses to let the public know exactly what it's spent billions developing. Now this film reveals its secrets. You can't miss it.",
